{
  "_comment": "The lakehouse side of CXR triage. Read by the CDE jobs (standard library json), the CAI lakehouse jobs (lakehouse/), the semantic SQL runner and the dashboards. Times are hospital local time (Asia/Kolkata), stored as timestamp without time zone.",
